This plugin contains material adapted from the "LLM cliché highlighter"
by Simon Willison, https://github.com/simonw/tools
(llm-cliche-highlighter.html), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. A copy of that license is in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

Changes made: the pattern list was reorganized into groups A to E,
each pattern was rewritten as a move with shapes and a fix, German
shapes and fixes were added, and patterns were renumbered. No code
from the original tool is included.

The pattern groups also draw on the Wikipedia project page
"Wikipedia:Signs of AI writing",
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Signs_of_AI_writing.
The patterns are described in this plugin's own words.
